# Check out text files with LF on every OS: several tests and profile/scripts/check.mjs read files with LF-only patterns,
# and core.autocrlf=true (common on Windows) would otherwise turn them into CRLF and fail a fresh clone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
